{"4435790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sector War", "steam_appid": 4435790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic space strategy adventure like never before! Command an elite space marine and challenge enemies in the vast expanses of the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to capture key stations and sectors, expanding the borders of your empire. Plan lightning raids on enemy positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in intense, eventful skirmishes that will test your skills as a commander. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Strategic Conquest: Capture key towers on the map to gain control;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— The game is suitable for the whole family;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Colorful graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a sci-fi universe where every decision matters. Can you determine the future of the Galaxy? Join the eventful adventure today and prove your strategic skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you need to capture all the towers on the map. To send an army, click on your tower and drag the mouse to the enemy or free tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a good game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic space strategy adventure like never before! Command an elite space marine and challenge enemies in the vast expanses of the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to capture key stations and sectors, expanding the borders of your empire. Plan lightning raids on enemy positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in intense, eventful skirmishes that will test your skills as a commander. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Strategic Conquest: Capture key towers on the map to gain control;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— The game is suitable for the whol